cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Software citations should specify the release version and model configuration."
type: software
title: "ThermoFEM-2D: Parametric finite element analysis of perforated plates"
authors:
  - family-names: Soroush
    given-names: Mehdi
version: 0.7.0
license: MIT
abstract: "Python research software for thermal and linear plane-stress thermoelastic FEM of rectangular perforated plates. T3 and affine T6 are production element options; a separate Q4 discretization and graded-mesh thermal-shock studies provide verification references. The experimental thermal-shock calculations are not validated engineering-design predictions."
